  * Test Production Tools. The flows of ./tools/prod.sh on a real
    stack (141 tests; 15 more ask for a Cloudflare token and run in
    Verify Cloudflare), and the update chain: three releases on one
    host, and what stops an update. 2026-11-12:
      https://github.com/ARAS-Workspace/phantom-wg/actions/runs/43168248771

  * Verify release packaging. The package tree and the two zips;
    each zip installs on a runner of its architecture without the
    registry. 2026-11-08:
      https://github.com/ARAS-Workspace/phantom-wg/actions/runs/42435988087

  * Verify install matrix. Two installs on each of eight
    distributions: Ubuntu 22.04, 24.04 and 26.04, Debian 12 and 13,
    Fedora 45, Arch and AlmaLinux 10.2. 2026-11-08:
      https://github.com/ARAS-Workspace/phantom-wg/actions/runs/42452212400

  * Verify certbot. A Let's Encrypt certificate on a host with a
    public address: nginx serves it and the authorities of the
    system verify it, the same command from a cron environment
    leaves the same certificate, and hard-reset removes its state.
    2026-11-11:
      https://github.com/ARAS-Workspace/phantom-wg/actions/runs/43072128053

  * Verify Cloudflare. The Cloudflare mode on a host with a public
